# Written at runtime by the web app: Jolpica schedule responses and
# resolved Wikipedia thumbnail URLs. Both are rebuildable caches.
data/cache/

# Records which data the local model.pkl was trained through. Machine-local
# by nature -- committing it would tell a fresh clone that the checked-in
# model is current when it almost certainly isn't.
model.pkl.meta.json
model.pkl.new
